{"seq":1,"slug":"commission-fee-model","title":"佣金/平台费/分账模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-seller-platform/settlement-billing/commission-fee-model","wordCount":3230,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"佣金-平台费-分账模型\">佣金/平台费/分账模型</h1><p>一个买家付了 100 欧元，平台要从中拿走一部分，卖家拿到剩下的。这句话在财务上是分账，在工程上却是一场关于「钱在谁手里、什么时候分、按什么规则分」的设计。最容易做错的形态是「先全额进平台账户，月底算完再打给卖家」——它看似简单，实则把平台变成了资金池，在多个市场带来牌照、税务与对账三重负担，且卖家的现金流体验极差。本文要讲的是把计费规则表达成<strong>版本化的规则 + 不可变的订单事实</strong>，以及分账为什么应该在支付时就完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-计费的输入必须是-不可变事实-版本化规则\">核心概念：计费的输入必须是「不可变事实 + 版本化规则」</h2><p>计费引擎的输出是费用流水，输入是两个东西的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊗</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = R(v_{rule}) \\otimes D_{order}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{order}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是订单事实（商品、类目、市场、买家所在国、履约方式、支付方式、金额、币种），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(v_{rule})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是规则在某个版本下的解释，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{rule}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该笔订单适用的规则版本。</p>\n<p>关键的判断是：<strong>订单事实不可变，规则版本按生效时间选取，计费结果一旦生成即冻结。</strong> 三条推论：</p>\n<p><strong>推论一：不能对历史订单重算。</strong> 3 月改了费率，2 月的订单必须仍然按 2 月的规则。实现上是规则表带 <code>effective_from</code> / <code>effective_to</code>，计费时用<strong>订单的业务时间</strong>（通常是支付完成或订单完成时刻）去选版本。用「当前规则」计算历史订单是账单纠纷的头号成因。</p>\n<p><strong>推论二：计费结果要冻结成流水。</strong> 计费算出「这笔订单佣金 15 欧」之后，把它写成一条费用流水记录，之后账单从流水聚合而不是重新计算。理由与只追加账本一致：账单必须可解释、可复核，而重新计算意味着账单会随规则的任何变化而漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>推论三：规则版本的选择要可复现。</strong> 给定订单事实，系统必须能回答「它适用哪个规则版本、为什么是那个版本」。这就要求规则匹配逻辑是确定性的（同一输入同一输出）且可重放（能拿历史事实重跑得到同一版本号）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常见做法</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用当前费率算历史订单</td>\n<td>改价即污染历史</td>\n<td>按订单业务时间选规则版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账单时实时重算</td>\n<td>结果随规则漂移</td>\n<td>计费即冻结为流水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率写死在代码里</td>\n<td>改率要发版</td>\n<td>规则表 + 生效区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个订单一条佣金</td>\n<td>多费用项无法表达</td>\n<td>费用项独立成行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"费用项的分解与可追溯\">费用项的分解与可追溯</h2><p>一笔订单上的费用通常不是一项。跨境场景下至少有：<strong>佣金（commission）</strong>（按类目分档的百分比）、<strong>支付处理费（payment processing）</strong>（按支付方式与币种不同）、<strong>履约费（fulfillment）</strong>（若走平台仓，按重量与体积）、<strong>平台使用费或订阅费</strong>（按月固定，摊到订单或单独立账）、<strong>市场特定税费代收代缴</strong>（平台视同供应商时的 VAT，它不是平台收入但影响资金流向）、<strong>营销推广费</strong>（若卖家投了站内广告）。</p>\n<p>设计上把每一项做成<strong>独立的费用行</strong>，而不是合并成一个「平台费用」数字。理由是：账单要能解释（卖家要看到佣金多少、履约多少）、争议要能定位（哪一项算错了）、税务要能分类（哪些是平台收入、哪些是代收代缴）、财务要能科目化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE fee_rule (&#10;  rule_id        BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  fee_type       VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,  -- commission | processing | fulfillment | subscription&#10;  market         CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  category_path  VARCHAR(256),          -- 类目树路径，NULL 表示该市场兜底&#10;  calc_mode      VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,  -- percent | flat | tiered | weight&#10;  params         JSON NOT NULL,         -- {&quot;rate&quot;:0.08,&quot;min&quot;:0.30,&quot;cap&quot;:null}&#10;  currency       CHAR(3),&#10;  effective_from DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   DATETIME(3),           -- NULL 表示当前生效&#10;  priority       INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 100,&#10;  KEY idx_lookup (market, fee_type, effective_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE fee_ledger (&#10;  fee_id       BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  shop_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  site_market  CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  fee_type     VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,         -- 冻结：这笔费用依据的规则版本&#10;  base_amount  DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,  -- 计费基数（通常是商品金额，不含税/含税分别记录）&#10;  amount       DECIMAL(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency     CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  direction    TINYINT NOT NULL,        -- +1 平台收 / -1 平台付（补贴、返还）&#10;  occurred_at  DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  idem_key     VARCHAR(160) NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_idem (idem_key),&#10;  KEY idx_order (order_id),&#10;  KEY idx_shop_time (shop_id, occurred_at)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fee_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fee_type       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- commission | processing | fulfillment | subscription</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_path  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 类目树路径，NULL 表示该市场兜底</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calc_mode      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- percent | flat | tiered | weight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  params         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"rate\":0.08,\"min\":0.30,\"cap\":null}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL 表示当前生效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_lookup (market, fee_type, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fee_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fee_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shop_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  site_market  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fee_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 冻结：这笔费用依据的规则版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计费基数（通常是商品金额，不含税/含税分别记录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- +1 平台收 / -1 平台付（补贴、返还）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idem_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_idem (idem_key),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_order (order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_shop_time (shop_id, occurred_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fee_ledger</code> 里两个字段值得强调。<strong><code>rule_id</code> 必须落库</strong>——它让每条费用可以回溯到「依据哪一版规则」，这是账单可解释性的技术基础，也是与 <a href=\"merchant-billing\">商家账单、对账与发票</a> 之间最重要的契约。<strong><code>idem_key</code> 加唯一索引</strong>——计费是消费者（消费订单事件），消息可能重复投递，唯一索引是防重复计费的最后防线；其构造必须是确定的，例如 <code>commission:{order_id}:{order_line_id}</code>。</p>\n<p>计费基数（<code>base_amount</code>）有跨境特有的歧义：<strong>含税还是不含税</strong>。欧盟市场平台视同供应商时，佣金通常按含 VAT 的成交额计算还是不含？不同平台口径不同，但<strong>同一笔订单只能有一个口径，且必须显式记录</strong>。因此需要两个字段或一个 <code>base_tax_mode</code> 标记，而不是让读取方猜测。这直接关系到后面发票的开具，见 <a href=\"merchant-billing\">商家账单、对账与发票</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分账-在支付点分开而不是事后转账\">分账：在支付点分开而不是事后转账</h2><p>分账（split payment）的语义是：买家支付的 100 欧元在资金流入平台的那一刻就被指示分成两份——15 给平台、85 给卖家（或进入卖家的待结算余额）。这与「全额入平台、后结算」的差别不是效率而是<strong>性质</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>事后结算（平台代收全部）</th>\n<th>支付点分账</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资金性质</td>\n<td>平台持有他人资金，构成资金池风险</td>\n<td>平台只持有自己的部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>牌照与合规</td>\n<td>可能触发支付服务或资金池监管</td>\n<td>通常更轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家现金流</td>\n<td>等结算周期</td>\n<td>接近实时进入待结算余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对账复杂度</td>\n<td>平台流水与卖家余额需双向核对</td>\n<td>分账指令与清算结果核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款处理</td>\n<td>从平台池退款，再冲卖家余额</td>\n<td>按比例或全额从对应方退回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>强度最高的是通过<strong>持牌支付服务商的分账能力</strong>（Stripe Connect、Adyen for Platforms、PingPong/Airwallex 等各家跨境收单方案都提供 marketplace 分账），平台只发「按这份分账方案拆」的指令，资金由服务商直接划给各方。这类能力是服务商的公开产品：Stripe Connect 面向市场平台提供在平台与卖家之间拆分收款、处理独立账户余额与 payout 的成套能力（来源：Stripe Connect 文档，<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/connect）；Adyen\">https://docs.stripe.com/connect）；Adyen</a> for Platforms 同样支持在授权或捕获时拆分支付、并按托管或自定义方式向用户 payout、同时托管资金直至打款（来源：Adyen for Platforms 文档，<a href=\"https://docs.adyen.com/platforms/）。这在跨境场景下还有一层好处：**结算币种与到账时间由持牌方处理**，平台不必自建多币种资金池。资金通道的选择与多币种换算属于多币种结算域的范畴，本文只定义**分账方案本身的数据结构**：\">https://docs.adyen.com/platforms/）。这在跨境场景下还有一层好处：**结算币种与到账时间由持牌方处理**，平台不必自建多币种资金池。资金通道的选择与多币种换算属于多币种结算域的范畴，本文只定义**分账方案本身的数据结构**：</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[订单支付成功] --&gt; B[读取订单事实]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按业务时间选取规则版本]&#10;    C --&gt; D[逐项计算费用&lt;br/&gt;佣金/处理费/履约费]&#10;    D --&gt; E[生成 fee_ledger 条目&lt;br/&gt;冻结 rule_id]&#10;    E --&gt; F[构造分账方案&lt;br/&gt;平台部分 + 卖家部分]&#10;    F --&gt; G[提交支付服务商分账指令]&#10;    G --&gt; H{清算结果}&#10;    H --&gt;|成功| I[卖家待结算余额增加]&#10;    H --&gt;|失败| J[进入补偿队列&lt;br/&gt;重试或改走事后结算]&#10;    I --&gt; K[供账单聚合与提现]\">graph TD\n    A[订单支付成功] --&gt; B[读取订单事实]\n    B --&gt; C[按业务时间选取规则版本]\n    C --&gt; D[逐项计算费用&lt;br/&gt;佣金/处理费/履约费]\n    D --&gt; E[生成 fee_ledger 条目&lt;br/&gt;冻结 rule_id]\n    E --&gt; F[构造分账方案&lt;br/&gt;平台部分 + 卖家部分]\n    F --&gt; G[提交支付服务商分账指令]\n    G --&gt; H{清算结果}\n    H --&gt;|成功| I[卖家待结算余额增加]\n    H --&gt;|失败| J[进入补偿队列&lt;br/&gt;重试或改走事后结算]\n    I --&gt; K[供账单聚合与提现]</pre><p>这里有一条必须处理的失败路径：<strong>分账指令提交后清算失败怎么办</strong>。可能的原因包括服务商限额、卖家账户被冻结、币种不支持。处理原则是<strong>不能让钱悬空</strong>——要么重试到成功，要么降级为「全额入平台、标记该订单为事后结算」。第二种降级路径必须在系统里被显式支持，因为它在跨境场景下会真实发生（某个市场的收款渠道突然不可用）。设计上让 <code>settlement_mode</code> 成为订单上的一个字段（<code>split</code> / <code>post_paid</code>），而不是全局配置——这样历史订单的结算方式可追溯，且模式切换不会影响在途订单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则匹配的确定性\">规则匹配的确定性</h2><p>当规则以「市场 + 类目 + 费用类型 + 生效区间 + 优先级」组织时，匹配可能命中多条。必须定义确定的裁决规则，否则同一订单在不同时间计算出不同结果——这会直接摧毁账单的可信度。</p>\n<p>裁决顺序建议是：<strong>先按生效区间过滤，再按具体度排序</strong>（类目路径更长的优先、市场更具体的优先），具体度相同时按 <code>priority</code> 小者优先，仍相同则取 <code>effective_from</code> 最新者，最后仍相同则判定为配置冲突并<strong>拒绝计费并告警</strong>。最后一条很重要：宁可让订单计费失败并进入人工处理，也不要静默选一条规则——静默选一条意味着账单上会出现无法解释的数，而人工处理至少留下痕迹。</p>\n<p>类目分档还有一个现实问题：<strong>类目会变</strong>。卖家把商品从「电子」挪到「家居」，费率随之变化。若规则按订单上的类目快照匹配（推荐），则历史订单的费率不因搬家而变；若按商品当前类目匹配，则历史账单会漂移。因此 <code>fee_ledger</code> 需要记录计费时使用的类目路径，而这个路径应来自订单行上的快照，与商品目录域的类目树标识对齐。</p>\n<p>分档（tiered）计费的实现有一个易错点：<strong>分档是按单笔还是按周期累计</strong>。按单笔（每笔订单按其金额落在某档，适用该档费率）与按周期累计（当月总成交额落在某档，全月适用该档费率）是完全不同的两种计价，账单结果差异显著。这两者都必须能表达，因此 <code>calc_mode: tiered</code> 应带一个 <code>aggregation: per_order | per_period</code> 参数，而不是让实现者自己猜。分档函数的数学形式（以周期累计为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1, T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为档位边界，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1, r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为对应费率）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(\\text{GMV}) = \\begin{cases} \\text{GMV} \\cdot r_1 &amp; \\text{GMV} \\le T_1 \\\\ T_1 r_1 + (\\text{GMV}-T_1) r_2 &amp; \\text{GMV} &gt; T_1 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这是<strong>累进</strong>（分段累加）而非<strong>全额适用</strong>（跳档后全额按新费率）。两者在跨档点的结果差异很大，商业上必须明确，工程上必须是代码里的一个显式分支而不是隐含假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"税费与代收代缴的位置\">税费与代收代缴的位置</h2><p>跨境结算里最容易把账做乱的是税。需要先分清三种情形：</p>\n<p><strong>情形一：卖家自行申报。</strong> 平台不介入，账单上不出现税这一行，<code>base_amount</code> 的口径（含税/不含税）由平台约定。</p>\n<p><strong>情形二：平台作为市场代收（marketplace facilitator）。</strong> 在欧盟、英国、美国部分州等被认定为视同供应商的市场，平台负责收取并申报 VAT/销售税。欧盟侧的「视为供应商」（deemed supplier）规则自 2021-07-01 起对在线市场促成的相关 B2C 货物远程销售适用，即平台在特定情形下被税务上视为自己接收并供应了货物（来源：欧盟 VAT 一站式服务官方说明，<a href=\"https://vat-one-stop-shop.ec.europa.eu/index_en）。此时税既不是平台收入也不是卖家收入，而是**代收代缴的过手资金**。工程上它必须与佣金等平台收入分开记账，绝不能混在同一个余额里——否则平台的收入报表会被过手资金虚增，且申报时无法取数。\">https://vat-one-stop-shop.ec.europa.eu/index_en）。此时税既不是平台收入也不是卖家收入，而是**代收代缴的过手资金**。工程上它必须与佣金等平台收入分开记账，绝不能混在同一个余额里——否则平台的收入报表会被过手资金虚增，且申报时无法取数。</a></p>\n<p><strong>情形三：平台提供税务代理服务。</strong> 平台替卖家注册与申报，会向卖家收取服务费。这笔是平台收入。</p>\n<p>区分三者的字段必须是站点级的显式配置（本 hub 的 <a href=\"../onboarding-kyc/merchant-account-model\">主体/店铺/站点账户模型</a> 中 <code>shop_site.tax_mode</code> 就是它的落位），而不是靠类目或金额推断。退税与冲销（订单退款时税如何退回）遵循同一套分类：代收的税退回给买家，平台收入按规则冲销。这条规则决定了 <a href=\"merchant-dispute\">扣款/冻结/纠纷处理</a> 里退款扣减的正确金额——把代收税也扣给卖家是常见错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>计费引擎的全部设计可以压缩成一条：<strong>输入是不可变的订单事实加版本化的规则，输出是冻结的费用流水</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不重算历史</strong>：按订单业务时间选规则版本（<code>effective_from</code>/<code>effective_to</code>），<code>rule_id</code> 落库使每条费用可回溯。</li>\n<li>费用<strong>分项独立成行</strong>（佣金/处理费/履约费/订阅/税/推广），支撑解释、争议定位、税务分类与科目化。</li>\n<li>计费基数要显式标注<strong>含税/不含税口径</strong>，不能留给读取方猜。</li>\n<li><strong>分账在支付点完成</strong>优于事后结算：资金性质、牌照负担、卖家现金流、对账复杂度四项皆优；必须支持降级为事后结算的路径，并让 <code>settlement_mode</code> 落在订单上。</li>\n<li>规则匹配必须<strong>确定性</strong>：生效区间 → 具体度 → 优先级 → 最新生效，冲突时<strong>拒绝并告警</strong>而非静默选一条；类目用订单行快照。</li>\n<li>分档计费要区分<strong>按笔与按周期</strong>、<strong>累进与全额适用</strong>；跨档公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = T_1r_1 + (\\text{GMV}-T_1)r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须是显式分支。</li>\n<li>税的三种情形（卖家自报/平台代收/平台代理）必须显式分类，<strong>过手资金与平台收入分开记账</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文产出费用流水，它的聚合与呈现见 <a href=\"merchant-billing\">商家账单、对账与发票</a>；负向调整与例外路径见 <a href=\"merchant-dispute\">扣款/冻结/纠纷处理</a>；币种口径与资金通道归多币种结算域。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"佣金/平台费/分账模型","id":"佣金-平台费-分账模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：计费的输入必须是「不可变事实 + 版本化规则」","id":"核心概念-计费的输入必须是-不可变事实-版本化规则"},{"level":2,"text":"费用项的分解与可追溯","id":"费用项的分解与可追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"分账：在支付点分开而不是事后转账","id":"分账-在支付点分开而不是事后转账"},{"level":2,"text":"规则匹配的确定性","id":"规则匹配的确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"税费与代收代缴的位置","id":"税费与代收代缴的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商家开放 API 与限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-seller-platform/permissions-subaccount/api-open-platform"},"next":{"title":"商家账单、对账与发票","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-seller-platform/settlement-billing/merchant-billing"}}